A quote opened on its own line in an item takes the first-block form

```
- a
  > +
  q
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
1. a
   - b
     > +
     | c |
.
<ol>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <blockquote>
          <table>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>c</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>
```
